<!-- MOS Protocol 4.0 DTD
     Extracted from chapter 8 of the MOS v4.0.1 specification
     (verbatim source: reference/MOS Protocol 4.0 (Current).html).
     Regenerate with tools/extract_fixtures.py; do not edit by hand.
     Spec DTD errata applied to make it a loadable DTD:
     - spec ch.8 prints '<!ELEMENT keepalive>' (no content model, miscased); the mos content model and the XSD use 'keepAlive' as an EMPTY element
